#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:7
msgid "Decides if the buttons for the special Spanish characters are visible."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat de Knööp för de besünneren spaanschen Bookstaven sichtbor "
"sünd."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:12
msgid "Decides if the KVTML-files are loaded automatically."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wat de KVTML-Dateien automatsch laadt warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:17
msgid "Decides whether a verb selection will be used or the entire verb stock."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wat en Köör oder all Verben bruukt warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:22
msgid ""
"Trained verbs that are not in the user's verb selection are added to the "
"selection automatically."
msgstr ""
"Öövt Verben, de dat nich binnen den Bruker sien Verbenköör gifft, warrt ehr "
"automaatsch toföögt."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:23
msgid ""
"The user can select verbs they know and want to practice using a verb "
"selection - a subset of all verbs. In some trainers the user can be faced "
"with verbs that are not yet in the selection; for example, in the "
"VerbViewTrainer if a word is entered that is not yet in the selection.  If "
"this option is set, such verbs are added automatically to the list."
msgstr ""
"De Bruker kann binnen en Verben-Utwahl begäng Verben utsöken, de he öven "
"will. Dit is en Ünnersett vun all Verben. En poor Öven stellt ok Verben "
"praat, de noch nich binnen de Utwahl sünd, a.B. de \"VerbViewTrainer\". Is "
"disse Optschoon anmaakt, warrt disse Verben automaatsch toföögt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:28
msgid "Decides whether the accents are ignored while correcting input or not."
msgstr ""
"Fastleggen, wat Akzenten wielt de Korrektuuringaav övergahn warrt oder nich."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:33
msgid "If true, the Spanish infinitive will always be used."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt jümmers de spaansche Grundform bruukt."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:34 kverbos.kcfg:40 kverbos.kcfg:46
msgid ""
"If a KVTML file is loaded, there might be a translation for a verb.  In this "
"case, the program can present the verb either in Spanish; according to the "
"translation; or an arbitrary mix of the two."
msgstr ""
"Wenn en KVTML-Datei laadt wöör, gifftt dat villicht en Översetten för en "
"Verb. Dat Programm kann dat Verb denn op Spaansch, översett, oder tofällig "
"mischt wiesen."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:39
msgid "If true, the Foreign infinitive will always be used."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt jümmers de butenlannsche Grundform bruukt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:45
msgid "If true, the Spanish and foreign infinitives will be used arbitrarily."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt spaansch un butenlannsch Grundformen tofällig mischt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:51
msgid "Single User"
msgstr "Een Bruker"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:52
msgid ""
"If this option is not set, the program starts with an user login widget "
"where the user can select their learning group and their name. If this "
"option is set, the user login widget is not shown and the default user "
"settings are used throughout."
msgstr ""
"Is disse Optschoon utmaakt, start dat Programm mit en Anmellenfinster för de "
"Ingaav vun Lehrkoppel un Brukernaam. Is dit anmaakt, warrt jümmers ahn "
"Anmellenfinster mit de Instellen för den Standardbruker start."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:57
msgid "The name of the last user using the program."
msgstr "Den verleden Bruker sien Naam"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (translationLanguage), group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:62
msgid "Set the default translation."
msgstr "De Standard-Översetten fastleggen"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (minimalNumberOfVerbs), group (kverbos)
#: kverbos.kcfg:67
msgid ""
"In the trainer forms there need to be at least this many verbs for a "
"learning session.  If there are fewer than this, some verbs that are blocked "
"at the moment are used to fill the list of verbs to learn."
msgstr ""
"De Formentrainer schull tominnst de lüttst Tall vun Verben för en Less "
"bargen. Mit weniger Verben warrt de Öven-List mit en poor opstunns noch "
"torüchhollen Verben vullmaakt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (clock)
#: kverbos.kcfg:75 kverbos.kcfg:79
msgid ""
"Decides if the clock is used as a clock or a timer that counts backwards."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat de Klock as Klock bruukt warrt, oder as torüchtellen "
"Stoppklock."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (clock)
#: kverbos.kcfg:83
msgid "The time in minutes the timer should count."
msgstr "De Tietvörgaav för de Stoppklock in Minuten"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kvtml)
#: kverbos.kcfg:91
msgid "If true then the contents of the KVTML files in the list are loaded."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt de oplist KVTML-Dateien ehr Inholt laadt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (fileList), group (kvtml)
#: kverbos.kcfg:95
msgid "A list of KVTML files that are parsed to look for translations of verbs"
msgstr ""
